{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "全"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執事設座竟，鳴磬三椎，接疎鐘，方丈傳香，大眾俱集，復傳鑪。座上侍者禮畢，擂鼓，鐘聲迅速。開導率諸子\n至方丈前，長跪合掌，開導進門，觸具一拜，起身傍立，召諸子云：作禮。一拜起身，又問訊，末後前行和尚舉："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾同和，迎至法堂前。諸子兩邊，長跪合掌。和尚或遶壇\n拜畢，陞座開導。鳴磬一下，鐘鼓肅靜。二開導，向上大展。三拜，長跪合掌。和尚問云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "收具，起問\n訊，傍立。召首者云：上香。又云：一齊起身，向上排班。聞磬聲，至誠頂三拜，長跪，合掌，開導，舉香讚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三遍開導，召諸子云：作禮三拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱念云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召諸子云：作禮一拜，起身問訊。轉身，和尚舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共諸子同和子每句一拜畢，問訊，和尚舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前。和拜竟，開導云：起身問訊。轉身長跪合掌。和尚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召諸子答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸子作禮一拜，師舉淨瓶與羯磨。師又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召諸子答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸子作禮\n一拜，師舉剃刀與教授二闍黎，出眾灌頂剃頭。師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導同眾，每句接和。師復舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾接和同前。師復舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二闍黎灌頂剃頭竟，問訊歸位，接和同前。開導召云：作禮三拜。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和尚加持，沙彌應接。\n師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙彌某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上一一師傳，舉子接應。\n傳鉢畢，開導，召沙彌云：起身傍立掛鉢。　師舉偈云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "掛畢，止念開導，召諸子云：向上長跪合掌。\n師又加持衣具，轉遮同前。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上眾亦然，隨聲隨和隨拜畢，　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
