{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每句隨和拜畢，師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上一一，師三舉，子三答畢，三拜。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召沙彌云：作禮三拜。開導復云：受五戒者起身出。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師撫尺云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮。一拜起身，　師舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：不勞起具，至誠頂禮　和尚。諸師三拜，起具問訊。又云：分班。又云：末後前行，至此鐘鼓齊鳴。師舉："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至方丈前開導，召沙彌云：長跪合掌。候　師入室開導，作禮三拜，起身傍立。召沙彌云：作禮一拜，起身問\n訊。又云：分班。末後前行，鍾鼓齊止。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執事設座畢，鳴磬三下。禪堂開，大靜接鐘。方丈傳香，大眾俱集。侍者傳爐，座上拜訖。開導滾擊子，殿主擂\n\n鼓。復召沙彌末後前行，至九師所。沙彌兩邊對面立定，開導向九師觸具一拜，傍立。召沙彌云：向上排班，\n作禮一拜，問訊分班。又云：末後前行，至方丈前，轉身長跪，合掌開導，佇立門外。九師轉身傍立，待羯磨師\n至，住立中央。諸師一齊向上一拜，各歸本位。開導展具，作禮三拜，起身傍立。召沙彌云：一齊起身，向上排\n班，展半具，作禮三拜，問訊長跪，合掌開導。云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
