{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召沙彌云：至誠作禮三拜。開導作白云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導作梵，沙彌隨和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨闍黎云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙彌\n答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導召戒子云：作禮一拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導作梵，沙彌隨和。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜。　和尚撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙彌答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導，召沙彌云：作禮一拜起，具問訊分班。又云：末後\n前行和尚舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾隨和，迎至法堂前。沙彌轉身，對面長跪合掌。十師進\n法堂，遶壇一帀，旋至二級，向上莊立。執事鳴磬三下，鐘鼓暫止。次十師大展三拜，長跪合掌，開導跪前，宣\n祝聖文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和尚俯地稱名開導，又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和尚起身舉云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每句隨和畢，十師作禮一拜，起具問訊。　和尚復舉："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以舉菩薩鐘鼓齊鳴，旋至建壇菩薩所，十師齊跪。和尚拈香畢，\n一齊起身，展半具，作禮三拜，問訊。　和尚仍舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾師同和，遶壇一帀，即便陞座。九師亦然。開導鳴磬，鐘鼓\n肅靜。開導大展三拜，起身傍立，滾擊一振。和尚拈香云：每拈瓣香畢，開導滾擊子一遍。拈香事畢，開導召\n沙彌云：上香竟。開導云：一齊起身，向上排班。展全具，和尚舉："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每句戒子接和四句，四拜開導云：問訊。又云：長跪合掌。和尚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三\n拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下"}
