{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作\n禮三拜。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作\n\n禮三拜以上，恭請三寶諸天，必須身心清淨，生難遭想。戒子凡禮，宜當五體投地，不得慢意。珍重。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮一拜起身。師舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒子每句隨聲和訖，頂禮一拜畢，開導云：長跪合掌。　師撫尺白眾云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "待沙彌至彼處\n已，　師撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸師答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨闍黎云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教授師答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨\n師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上某、下某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良久"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尊證答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壇上諸師鳴魚，\n誦大悲呪。教授師從座起，整衣出眾，向法座前端莊問訊而去。引請前行，引教授師至法堂前云：乞戒者\n兩行長跪合掌，待教授師至法座前問訊而坐。引請又云：乞戒者起身向上排班，一字具落地。合掌又云：\n乞戒弟子某甲，戒子稱自名。引請云：頂禮。教授師起身問訊，長跪合掌諦聽。教授師撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教云："}
