{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說戒。子三答。師又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。戒子三答。　師又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說三答。開導云：作禮三拜。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮一拜起\n身。和尚舉云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唱三和，拜。開導云：問訊，長跪合掌。師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。　師即出位，焚香作梵，白云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "情戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師即起身就位，撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上從仰白十方起，下至此能持，三番俱同。師又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師又出位，作梵白云：同前已畢。復就位，撫尺云：上亦然。又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師更出位，焚香\n作梵，白云：亦同前。畢，師更就位，撫尺云：亦同上。師又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師撫尺又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師復撫尺云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和尚又云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲。　師舉錫杖云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師振杖云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又振杖云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師舉杖與羯磨或教授一一傳去，呪眾當隨和，待傳畢方止。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呪云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮三拜。　師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：作禮一拜，起身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師舉回向偈云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開導云：不勞起具，至誠頂禮壇上諸師三拜。起身問訊，分班開導，大展三拜畢。又云：末後前行，師舉　南\n無本師釋迦牟尼佛，迎至方丈前。戒子轉身，長跪合掌。候師入室，敷座開導。拜畢，起身傍立云：一齊起身，\n向上排班。展全具，開導召云：新受菩薩戒弟子某甲。眾齊稱名，聞磬聲，至誠頂禮九拜訖。起具問訊，分班\n\n後前行。至法堂前，鐘鼓齊止。諸戒子聽開導師教誡，或歸堂，或巡寮。戒子須知，開導師勞苦至極，恩過諸\n師。凡此三壇大戒，始終󴏃事。須當至誠禮謝，不得慢意。珍重珍重。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
